{"4671920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "B.F.G:Crew", "steam_appid": 4671920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BFG: Crew is a multiplayer co-op game that lets you and your friends control a ridiculously massive cannon. <br>This complex task requires communication and coordination to succeed... and many things can go wrong along the way. <br><br>One of you will take on the role of the Spotter, spotting incoming enemies, calculating the angle and azimuth, and leading the crew as they load, move, and prepare the cannon by pushing and interacting with numerous levers, dials, buttons, and controls before finally unleashing its devastating firepower !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG CANNON </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Apocalypse has happened, humanity has lost the great war against the mech, and all the other City-Fortress have gone silent..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of the only weapon able to keep the mech at bay, The B.F.G. <br>The last Relic of humanity ingenuity and madness from an age of war, capable of dealing unprecedented level of destruction. <br>If you fail to protect the Last city, nobody will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG MECHS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass and the city survives, the mechs' assaults will grow stronger and stronger. They will deploy increasingly advanced mechs of different types: artillery bots that bombard you from afar, land factories that send waves of exploding bots, or even giant flying Stratofortresses that rain down salvos of guided missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave will be harder than the last. How long will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG SHELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and replenish your stock, then choose between multiple shell types to load, such as the classic HE, the high-velocity AP, the non-conventional Laser Shell, or even the mighty Nuclear Shell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shell has its own advantages, but they all come at a cost. Will you be able to manage your resources?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOT OF INTERACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with numerous levers, buttons, and controls in the correct sequence to select the desired shell, move it, push it, lift it, load it, adjust the B.F.G.'s azimuth and elevation, open and close it, don't forget to close the blast doors behind you, and finally fire the cannon !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crewing this massive artillery piece will require teamwork and communication. Use proximity voice chat to coordinate with your crewmates and handle every task as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the game's most important interactions can be completed much faster in co-op. For example, pushing a shell or adjusting the B.F.G.'s azimuth is far easier when you have another crewmate helping you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMETRIC GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this task, one of you will have to assume the role of the Spotter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In its small command room upstairs, isolated from the other crewmates, the Spotter will be responsible for giving instructions and orders to the team using camera screens and a global speaker system retransmitting its voice almost everywhere in the B.F.G. bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spotter has access to various important tools:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A radar screen:</strong> Some enemies might not be immediately visible, but the radar will help you find the general direction they are coming from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A periscope:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to visually identify incoming enemies and provide vital data such as azimuth, height, and distance from the aimed location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A field manual:</strong> Providing all the necessary information to identify target types, their weaknesses and strengths, and helping decide the best shell type to use against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An angle calculator:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to calculate the angle the B.F.G. needs to fire at a given point, using data such as the distance, height of the target location, and the selected shell velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A control wall:</strong> Displaying all current data about the B.F.G. and its bunker, including its current integrity, azimuth, elevation angle, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera system:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to monitor the rest of the crew's actions through surveillance screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A microphone:</strong> Broadcasting the Spotter's voice through a global speaker system across the entire bunker, allowing communication with the rest of the crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GLORY TO THE B.F.G, LONG LIVE THE LAST CITY</strong>  <br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/3c4c4cc8f66f4a5230a200fb0d5f1965.avif?t=1786827750\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras_big/3c4c4cc8f66f4a5230a200fb0d5f1965.webp?t=1786827750 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BFG: Crew is a multiplayer co-op game that lets you and your friends control a ridiculously massive cannon. <br>This complex task requires communication and coordination to succeed... and many things can go wrong along the way. <br><br>One of you will take on the role of the Spotter, spotting incoming enemies, calculating the angle and azimuth, and leading the crew as they load, move, and prepare the cannon by pushing and interacting with numerous levers, dials, buttons, and controls before finally unleashing its devastating firepower !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG CANNON </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Apocalypse has happened, humanity has lost the great war against the mech, and all the other City-Fortress have gone silent..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of the only weapon able to keep the mech at bay, The B.F.G. <br>The last Relic of humanity ingenuity and madness from an age of war, capable of dealing unprecedented level of destruction. <br>If you fail to protect the Last city, nobody will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/d9fec33dec5cbf4f540e9d4c7222e456.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG MECHS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass and the city survives, the mechs' assaults will grow stronger and stronger. They will deploy increasingly advanced mechs of different types: artillery bots that bombard you from afar, land factories that send waves of exploding bots, or even giant flying Stratofortresses that rain down salvos of guided missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave will be harder than the last. How long will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG SHELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and replenish your stock, then choose between multiple shell types to load, such as the classic HE, the high-velocity AP, the non-conventional Laser Shell, or even the mighty Nuclear Shell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shell has its own advantages, but they all come at a cost. Will you be able to manage your resources?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/27463246eb278ca95223cca5b5349629.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOT OF INTERACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with numerous levers, buttons, and controls in the correct sequence to select the desired shell, move it, push it, lift it, load it, adjust the B.F.G.'s azimuth and elevation, open and close it, don't forget to close the blast doors behind you, and finally fire the cannon !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/f25a1453eafa0f3c7812b09fa5e22588.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crewing this massive artillery piece will require teamwork and communication. Use proximity voice chat to coordinate with your crewmates and handle every task as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the game's most important interactions can be completed much faster in co-op. For example, pushing a shell or adjusting the B.F.G.'s azimuth is far easier when you have another crewmate helping you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cb229a7b5ee9f425ef18e04076d7464c.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMETRIC GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this task, one of you will have to assume the role of the Spotter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In its small command room upstairs, isolated from the other crewmates, the Spotter will be responsible for giving instructions and orders to the team using camera screens and a global speaker system retransmitting its voice almost everywhere in the B.F.G. bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spotter has access to various important tools:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A radar screen:</strong> Some enemies might not be immediately visible, but the radar will help you find the general direction they are coming from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A periscope:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to visually identify incoming enemies and provide vital data such as azimuth, height, and distance from the aimed location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A field manual:</strong> Providing all the necessary information to identify target types, their weaknesses and strengths, and helping decide the best shell type to use against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An angle calculator:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to calculate the angle the B.F.G. needs to fire at a given point, using data such as the distance, height of the target location, and the selected shell velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A control wall:</strong> Displaying all current data about the B.F.G. and its bunker, including its current integrity, azimuth, elevation angle, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera system:</strong> Allowing the Spotter to monitor the rest of the crew's actions through surveillance screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A microphone:</strong> Broadcasting the Spotter's voice through a global speaker system across the entire bunker, allowing communication with the rest of the crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.poster.avif?t=1786827750\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.webm?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671920/extras/cdefe731f04ba13f83d4f135349b0243.mp4?t=1786827750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GLORY TO THE B.F.G, LONG LIVE THE LAST CITY</strong>  <br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i